{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47284","headline":"游仙二十四首 二十一 · 吴筠","name":"游仙二十四首 二十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"整驾辞五岳，排烟凌九霄。\n纷然太虚中，羽斾更相招。\n且盼蓬壶近，谁言崑阆遥。\n悠悠竟安适，仰赴三天朝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47284.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47284","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}